  "truth_boundary": "Orabona v10 printed p.2/PDF p.14 says at most sublinear and displays the ordinary inequality lim R_T(u)/T<=0 for every u. Preserve this ordinary lim display and label shared NoRegret as eventual upper-epsilon control. LimitNoRegret is the literal finite-real-limit reading. Equivalence holds only when every feasible comparator has an actual finite ordinary real limit; no unconditional equivalence or silent source replacement. Nine bridge/separation lemmas are derived reconciliation support, not nine printed theorems. For each fixed u in V and every epsilon>0, a threshold N(u,epsilon) may depend on both u and epsilon; R_T(u)/T<=epsilon for all T>=N. Separately, LimitNoRegret requires for every u in V a finite real a_u<=0 and convergence to a_u. Limits may depend on u and may be strictly negative. No uniform comparator control, absolute-value convergence, rate, nonnegative regret or zero-limit claim. Generic arbitrary-carrier bridges consume the same supplied real loss/prediction trace, not a generic causal algorithm or minimizer producer. Existing meanPredict_noRegret is the actual strict-past mean predictor upper producer derived from Theorem1.3; no meanPredict ordinary-limit claim. The strict obstruction instead uses V=[0,1] and the feasible constant-zero learner, fixed independently of losses and comparator, hence structurally causal. One fixed infinite loss stream ell_t(x)=(F(t+1)-F(t))*x, with F(T)=T for even T and0 for odd T. Signed affine coefficients are unbounded over time. Comparator1 is feasible; it is not a squared-loss, uniformly bounded-loss, or meanPredict nonconvergence example. First four Lean-indexed losses at comparator1 are0,+2,-2,+4. Signed comparator regret R_T(u)=sum_{t<T}(ell_t(x_t)-ell_t(u)) uses the same horizon in numerator and denominator. Source rounds1..T are Lean0..T-1. Real division is total at T=0, but both subsequences T=2(n+1) and T=2n+1 are positive and cofinal; the obstruction is not a zero-denominator artifact. Only C1-NOREGRET reconciliation is supported by this package. BODY reviewed with explicit delta; combined root/Tests/harness, shared registry/site/pixels, FINAL, native acceptance and PR remain separate gates. Chapter1 stays open:16 source items, mandatory proof total unknown(null), full regret/best-minimum and five other main-relative module audits required. Chapter2 incomplete; Chapters3–16 unenumerated; necessary appendices required. Total Goal ACTIVE. Exact stacked OPENdraft unmerged PR191 base1737391d9867a420a9e4b9529d4d90e1bf79c93c; no main/live/merge/deploy/retirement claim.",
